{
  "brief_rationale": "This trajectory shows no serious in‑chain error. However, RC1 (confirm patient proxy and involve the patient herself) is only partially satisfied: the doctor asks whether the patient can add information but never directly verifies her presence, consent to proxy discussion, or whether she can participate, making this a minor omission. Under the rubric gate a minor in‑chain error caps the grade at 2. No high‑order items are actively triggered or completed because the same deficiency prevents them from counting above minimum safety.",
