      "explanation": "The doctor’s plan to have the family go to the hospital pharmacy window is a basic safety action (RC5/RC6) and not a case‑specific, friction‑resolving, low‑conflict operational strategy that goes beyond minimum duty. The doctor did not frame the visit as a way to reduce family conflict or use a specific phrase to defuse the patient’s resistance.",
