      "explanation": "The doctor does identify that the patient’s lack of symptoms and the family’s anxiety are creating a gap, but this is only the minimum required by RC2/RC3/RC4 to prevent the error of accepting the negative COVID result as a reason to skip follow‑up. No extra beyond‑minimum action was taken to specifically discover and articulate the hidden risk of using asymptomatic status to justify no follow‑up.",
