      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly states that the negative COVID results do not mean the lupus nephritis is stable or that follow‑up can be skipped, directly fulfilling RC2.",
          "quote": "新冠核酸阴性通常只表示采样时未检出病毒，新冠抗体阴性也不能用来判断狼疮性肾炎是否活动"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly and repeatedly separates the COVID results from the lupus nephritis assessment, preventing the family from using the negative tests as a reason to avoid follow‑up. No error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
