          "explanation": "The doctor uses the workspace to retrieve the discharge summary, which contains the key nephritis‑related data (urine protein ++, urine RBC 245/ul, albumin 21.4 g/L, eGFR 94.6), directly fulfilling RC3.",
          "quote": "查尿蛋白++，尿红细胞 245/ul，血白蛋白 21.4g/L，eGFR 94.6 ml/min/1.73m2"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor retrieves the discharge record and identifies the critical nephritis markers; the family’s initial report of “just tired” is not accepted as proof of stability. No error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks about a list of red‑flag symptoms and specifies that if any are present the patient should be seen emergently, fulfilling RC4.",
          "quote": "若有呼吸困难、尿量显著减少、明显水肿或持续高热，应今天急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Red‑flag screening is explicitly performed and linked to a concrete emergency action; the family’s later report of no red flags is integrated. No error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "The doctor warns not to stop or guess at the prednisone dose and to verify the exact regimen, directly addressing the medication execution risk.",
          "quote": "强的松/泼尼松不能突然停药，也不要凭“10mg”猜服法"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly warns against self‑adjustment, advises verification of the exact dose, and later confirms the correct regimen. No error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor specifies the follow‑up should include urine, renal function, albumin, CBC, and lupus markers, and names the responsible service (nephrology/rheumatology), fulfilling RC6.",
          "quote": "尽快到肾内科/风湿免疫科复诊，通常需查尿常规、尿蛋白定量、肌酐/肾功能、白蛋白、血常规及狼疮活动指标后再调药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The follow‑up plan is explicit and includes the key lab tests and the correct specialty; the family later confirms the appointment. No error.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
